    title: "Senior Software Engineer",
    company: "Manatal",
    link: "https://www.manatal.com/",
    description:
      "I lead feature development from design to deployment, focusing on improving product performance and user experience. I collaborate closely with product and design to scope work, then implement end‑to‑end solutions using Vue.js and Django. I also design and optimise RESTful APIs for efficient data flow and scalability, and prioritise application security through best practices and regular audits.",
  },
  {
    date: "Sep 2021 - Oct 2024",
    title: "Software Engineer II",
    company: "Rapid7",
    link: "https://www.rapid7.com/",
    description:
      "I implemented new features and improvements for a cloud security analytics product, balancing usability and performance. I worked closely with designers to craft intuitive interfaces and graph visualisations using React and Highcharts JS, and contributed to backend services in Java and Python running on AWS. I regularly participated in code reviews, mentored junior engineers, and helped refine team processes to maintain high engineering standards.",
  },
  {
    date: "Jan 2020 - Sep 2021",
    title: "Senior Technology Analyst",
    company: "BearingPoint",
    link: "https://www.bearingpoint.com/en-ie/",
    description:
      "I contributed to the design and development of a microservice‑oriented application using Angular and Java Spring Boot in an Agile environment. I also focused heavily on quality, implementing extensive unit and integration tests for a .NET application during its migration from a monolithic architecture.",
  },
  {
    date: "Jan 2018 - Aug 2018",
    title: "Junior Web Developer Intern",
    company: "SAP Ireland",
    description:
      "I learned to design and develop web applications using the SAPUI5 SDK and ABAP, SAP’s in‑house language. I gained experience identifying and resolving code vulnerabilities while working alongside senior engineers.",
  },
  {
    date: "Feb 2015 - Aug 2015",
    title: "Web Development Apprentice",
    company: "BPM Marketing",
    description:
      "I designed, developed, and maintained the company’s WordPress website and built Python scripts for web scraping tasks. This role strengthened my foundations in web development, automation, and content management.",
  },
];
---

<ol class="relative mt-16">
  {
    EXPERIENCIE.map((experiencie) => (
      <li class="">
        <ExperienceItem {...experiencie} />
      </li>
    ))
  }
</ol>
